ening, until the clip ends.\\n\\nSCRIPT:\\n\\nLínea 1: \\\"¡Ay no!\\\"\\nDelivery: she only says her own lines, never the other person's questions or comments, and between lines stays silent, listening; she covers her mouth with one hand for an instant, delighted, then lowers the hand and says it with a short real laugh in her voice\\n\\nLínea 2: \\\"Ya mismo les escribo.\\\"\\nDelivery: she lifts her phone up from her lap into the frame, unlocks it and starts typing with both thumbs, smiling, excited; the back of the phone faces the camera, its screen is never visible\\n\\nAudio: she speaks in a natural everyday Colombian Spanish accent (not neutral Latin American, not Mexican, not from Spain) at a quick, animated conversational pace, confessional and self-deprecating, laughing at herself. Her voice is that of a 27-year-old woman: bright, light and medium-high in pitch, full of energy. The voice sounds like it's coming from a close podcast mic with little echo and reverberation. As her mouth moves away from the microphone, the audio changes in volume. Soft room tone of a small podcast studio, close-mic'd podcast sound.\",\n      \"referencias\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"n\": 4, \"tipo\": \"H\", \"habla\": \"B\", \"duracion\": 8, \"frame_inicial\": \"host-b\",\n      \"lineas\": [\n        { \"orden\": 2, \"texto\": \"¿En serio?\" },\n        { \"orden\": 16, \"texto\": \"Es el que da resultados rápidos y duraderos, que se quedan incluso después de terminarlo, y sin efecto rebote.\" }\n      ],\n      \"linea\": \"¿En serio? Es el que da resultados rápidos y duraderos, que se quedan incluso después de terminarlo, y sin efecto rebote.\",\n      \"prompt_imagen_inicial\": null, \"prompt_imagen_final\": null,\n      \"prompt_video\": \"Podcast-style video. Static camera, medium close-up framing locked to the start frame throughout. She speaks directly to someone off-camera, delivering multiple lines with natural pauses between them as if listening to responses.\\n\\n