uestions or comments, and between lines stays silent, listening; she covers her mouth with one hand for an instant, delighted, then lowers the hand and says it with a short real laugh in her voice\\n\\nLínea 2: \\\"Ya mismo les escribo.\\\"\\nDelivery: she lifts her phone up from her lap into the frame, unlocks it and starts typing with both thumbs, smiling, excited; the back of the phone faces the camera, its screen is never visible\\n\\nAudio: she speaks in a natural everyday Colombian Spanish accent (not neutral Latin American, not Mexican, not from Spain) at a quick, animated conversational pace, confessional and self-deprecating, laughing at herself. Her voice is that of a 27-year-old woman: bright, light and medium-high in pitch, full of energy. The voice sounds like it's coming from a close podcast mic with little echo and reverberation. As her mouth moves away from the microphone, the audio changes in volume. Soft room tone of a small podcast studio, close-mic'd podcast sound.\",\n      \"referencias\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"n\": 5, \"tipo\": \"H\", \"habla\": \"B\", \"duracion\": 8, \"frame_inicial\": \"host-b\",\n      \"lineas\": [\n        { \"orden\": 2, \"texto\": \"¿En serio?\" },\n        { \"orden\": 22, \"texto\": \"Es el que da resultados rápidos y duraderos, que se quedan incluso después de terminarlo, y sin efecto rebote.\" }\n      ],\n      \"linea\": \"¿En serio? Es el que da resultados rápidos y duraderos, que se quedan incluso después de terminarlo, y sin efecto rebote.\",\n      \"prompt_imagen_inicial\": null, \"prompt_imagen_final\": null,\n      \"prompt_video\": \"Podcast-style video. Static camera, medium close-up framing locked to the start frame throughout. She speaks directly to someone off-camera, delivering multiple lines with natural pauses between them as if listening to responses.\\n\\nNo captions. No background music. No camera movement or angle changes.\\n\\nShe says each line exactly as written, only once, without repeating, adding or changing any word, and without \\\"um\\\", \\\"uh\\\" or \\\"eh\\\" that are not in the script. After her last line she says nothing else: she stays silent, listening, until the clip ends.\\n\\nSCRIPT:\\n\\nLínea 1: \\\"¿En serio?\\\"\\nDelivery: she only says her own lines, never the other person's questions or comments, and between lines stays silent, listening; her eyes open wide and she leans toward her friend, surprised\\n\\nLínea 2: \\\"Es el que da resultados rápidos y duraderos, que se quedan incluso después de terminarlo, y sin efecto rebote.\\\"\\nDelivery: she turns her face to the camera for this line, serious and close, like a friend giving honest advice, marking each idea with a small beat of her hand; energetic, never slow\\n\\nAudio: she speaks in a natural everyday Colombian Spanish accent (not neutral Latin American, not Mexican, not from Spain), the same accent as her friend, at a lively conversational pace, a touch more measured than her friend, warm, confident and playful, like the friend who has already been through it. Her voice is that of a 30-year-old woman: fuller, slightly husky and a notch lower in pitch. The voice sounds like it's coming from a close podcast mic with little echo and reverberation. As her mouth moves away from the microphone, the audio changes in volume. Soft room tone of a small podcast studio, close-mic'd podcast sound.\",\n      \"referencias\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"n\": 6, \"tipo\": \"H\", \"habla\": \"B\", \"duracion\": 8, \"frame_inicial\": \"host-b\",\n      \"lineas\": [\n        { \"orden\": 4, \"texto\": \"¡Ay, no me digas!\" },\n        { \"orden\": 5, \"texto\": \"Yo estaba igualita, hasta que mi prima me dijo: \\\"Mija, antes del bisturí, pruébalo natural\\\".\" }\n      ],\n      \"linea\": \"¡Ay, no me digas! Yo estaba igualita, hasta que mi prima me dijo: \\\"Mija, antes del bisturí, pruébalo natural\\\".\",\n      \"prompt_imagen_inicial\": null, \"prompt_imagen_final\": null,\n    