\n    },\n    {\n      \"n\": 8, \"tipo\": \"H\", \"habla\": \"B\", \"duracion\": 8, \"frame_inicial\": \"host-b\",\n      \"lineas\": [\n        { \"orden\": 10, \"texto\": \"Hay unos que te dicen eso pa' venderte más caro, y ni siquiera traen todo lo que funciona.\" },\n        { \"orden\": 15, \"texto\": \"Nada que ver.\" }\n      ],\n      \"linea\": \"Hay unos que te dicen eso pa' venderte más caro, y ni siquiera traen todo lo que funciona. Nada que ver.\",\n      \"prompt_imagen_inicial\": null, \"prompt_imagen_final\": null,\n      \"prompt_video\": \"Podcast-style video. Static camera, medium close-up framing locked to the start frame throughout. She speaks directly to someone off-camera, delivering multiple lines with natural pauses between them as if listening to responses.\\n\\nNo captions. No background music. No camera movement or angle changes.\\n\\nShe says each line exactly as written, only once, without repeating, adding or changing any word, and without \\\"um\\\", \\\"uh\\\" or \\\"eh\\\" that are not in the script. After her last line she says nothing else: she stays silent, listening, until the clip ends.\\n\\nSCRIPT:\\n\\nLínea 1: \\\"Hay unos que te dicen eso pa' venderte más caro, y ni siquiera traen todo lo que funciona.\\\"\\nDelivery: she only says her own lines, never the other person's questions or comments, and between lines stays silent, listening; like sharing an insider tip, she rubs her thumb against her fingers when she talks about the price and then shakes her head; the word pa' is the short spoken form of 'para', said simply as 'pa'\\n\\nLínea 2: \\\"Nada que ver.\\\"\\nDelivery: she shakes her head calmly with a relaxed smile and reaches one hand out toward her friend off-camera, as if touching her arm to reassure her\\n\\nAudio: she speaks in a natural everyday Colombian Spanish accent (not neutral Latin American, not Mexican, not from Spain), the same accent as her friend, at a lively conversational pace, a touch more measured than her friend, warm, confident and playful, like the friend who has already been through it. Her voice is that of a 30-year-old woman: fuller, slightly husky and a notch lower in pitch. The voice sounds like it's coming from a close podcast mic with little echo and reverberation. As her mouth moves away from the microphone, the audio changes in volume. Soft room tone of a small podcast studio, close-mic'd podcast sound.\",\n      \"referencias\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"n\": 9, \"tipo\": \"H\", \"habla\": \"B\", \"duracion\": 10, \"frame_inicial\": \"host-b\",\n      \"lineas\": [\n        { \"orden\": 12, \"texto\": \"Que traiga aguaje, fenogreco y maca negra, los tres, en su máxima pureza.\" },\n        { \"orden\": 13, \"texto\": \"Eso es lo que da los resultados, no la marca.\" }\n      ],\n      \"linea\": \"Que traiga aguaje, fenogreco y maca negra, los tres, en su máxima pureza. Eso es lo que da los resultados, no la marca.\",\n      \"prompt_imagen_inicial\": null, \"prompt_imagen_final\": null,\n      \"prompt_video\": \"Podcast-style video. Static camera, medium close-up framing locked to the start frame throughout. She speaks directly to someone off-camera, delivering multiple lines with natural pauses between them as if listening to responses.\\n\\nNo captions. No background music. No camera movement or angle changes.\\n\\nShe says each line exactly as written, only once, without repeating, adding or changing any word, and without \\\"um\\\", \\\"uh\\\" or \\\"eh\\\" that are not in the script. After her last line she says nothing else: she stays silent, listening, until the clip ends.\\n\\nSCRIPT:\\n\\nLínea 1: \\\"Que traiga aguaje, fenogreco y maca negra, los tres, en su máxima pureza.\\\"\\nDelivery: she only says her own lines, never the other person's questions or comments, and between lines stays silent, listening; she counts the three ingredients on her fingers, one finger for each, and shows the three fingers together when she says 'los tr